{
  "id": "blazor.host-browser-client-with-backends",
  "edition": "11.0",
  "title": "Route a browser client",
  "goal": "Serve WASM deep links and backend calls through Gateway.",
  "areas": [
    "blazor"
  ],
  "exampleLanguages": [
    "csharp"
  ],
  "tags": [
    "quayside-routes"
  ],
  "apis": [
    "Components.Gateway",
    "AddBlazorClientServiceDefaults"
  ],
  "introducedIn": "11.0",
  "supportedTargets": [
    "11.0"
  ],
  "stability": "stable",
  "applicability": {
    "routes": [
      {
        "target": "11.0",
        "usage": "primary",
        "conditional": false,
        "selectionNotes": [
          "WASM; Gateway/defaults; Aspire if used."
        ],
        "requirements": {
          "runtime": {
            "name": ".NET",
            "version": "11.0",
            "match": "release-family",
            "reason": "WASM plus Gateway host."
          },
          "sdk": {
            "name": ".NET SDK",
            "version": "11.0",
            "match": "release-family",
            "reason": "Gateway and SPA manifests."
          },
          "language": {
            "name": "C#",
            "version": "15.0",
            "match": "exact",
            "reason": "Canonical mode; no new syntax."
          },
          "frameworks": [
            "Blazor"
          ],
          "packages": [
            {
              "name": "Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Gateway",
              "version": "11.0.0-rc.2.26504.105",
              "match": "exact",
              "reason": "Build/tool assets."
            },
            {
              "name": "Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.WebAssembly",
              "version": "11.0.0-rc.2.26504.105",
              "match": "exact",
              "reason": "Matching browser assets."
            },
            {
              "name": "Microsoft.Extensions.ServiceDiscovery",
              "version": "10.10.0",
              "match": "exact",
              "reason": "Generated defaults."
            }
          ],
          "workloads": [],
          "packageAssets": [
            "Gateway tool/manifests; generated defaults/initializer"
          ],
          "providers": [
            "YARP; configuration service discovery"
          ],
          "platforms": [
            "Browser WASM; local .NET host"
          ],
          "renderingModes": [
            "WebAssembly"
          ],
          "prerequisites": [
            "Complete old/new projects, exact package pins, configuration, generated defaults and browser assets below. RC2 SDK 11.0.100-rc.2.26504.105; older SDK 10.0.402/runtime 10.0.13. Interpreted WASM needs no wasm-tools/AOT/native workload.",
            "Use generated blazorwasm-servicedefaults library and its .lib.module.js; retain its assembly name/static asset path. OpenTelemetry packages 1.19.1 (exporter/hosting), 1.19.0 (HTTP/runtime instrumentation) are pinned below.",
            "Aspire dependency when used: an actual compatible Aspire AppHost/integration must supply service references and Gateway/browser configuration. This manual loopback route uses no Aspire orchestrator, account, container or provisioning; it does not verify an Aspire route."
          ],
          "constraints": [
            "WASM; Components.Gateway, generated service-defaults library; Aspire dependency when used.",
            "Gateway is a build/tool/manifest contract, not a normal lib API. Do not call framework-test-only BlazorGateway.BuildWebHost. StaticWebAssetSpaFallbackEnabled=true adds a nonfile index endpoint; API proxy routes must win, and backend 404 must remain 404.",
            "ClientApps config is public. Browser logical quays resolves to the entry origin; Gateway logical quaybackend resolves to the real loopback backend. Never expose credentials or authoritative permissions.",
            "This edition selects target 11 only. The compiled/executed .NET 10 ASP.NET Core host/YARP comparison remains valid; it does not claim older Gateway or generated-template support and adds no ninth .NET 10 foundation.",
            "Local HTTP/development manifests only. HttpsRedirection and telemetry are disabled explicitly for loopback. Production TLS, authentication, path-base hosting, deployment, watch/debugger tooling, OTLP delivery, Aspire, trimming/AOT and GA need their own verification."
          ],
          "optIns": [],
          "stabilityLimitations": [
            "RC2; GA pending. No Experimental attribute opt-in in this route."
          ]
        },
        "evidenceSamples": [
          "samples/net11.0/QuaysideRoutes/Client/QuaysideRoutes.Client.csproj",
          "samples/net11.0/QuaysideRoutes/Defaults/QuaysideRoutes.Defaults.csproj",
